              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantwana babo abasala emva kwabo ezweni, abantwana bakwa-Israyeli ababengenakubaqalekisa, uSolomoni wabakhokhisa intela yenkonzo kuze kube namuhla.",
