              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa kubantwana bakwa-Israyeli uSolomoni akenzanga sigqila, kodwa baba amaqhawe nezinceku zakhe nezikhulu zakhe nezinduna zakhe nezinduna zezinqola zakhe nabamahhashi bakhe.",
