        {
          "text": "USolomoni wanikela ngeminikelo yokushiswa neminikelo yokubonga kathathu ngomnyaka e-altare ayelakhele uJehova, wanyusa impepho phezu kwe-altare elaliphambi kukaJehova. Wayiqeda ke indlu.",
